            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "> Thanks for the issue!\r\n> \r\n> I don't really understand this. There are exactly two scenarios here:\r\n> \r\n>     * Color scheme does not define `MiniFilesCursorLine` explicitly. In this case it is linked to `CursorLine`. If it is such that cursor becomes invisible inside current line, it is color scheme's fault.\r\n> \r\n>     * Color scheme does define `MiniFilesCursorLine` explicitly. In this case it is color scheme's responsibility to choose it such that cursor is visible.\r\n> \r\n> \r\n> Am I missing something here?\r\n\r\nYou're overlooking the following:\r\n\r\n```\r\nvim.opt.guicursor    : append [[n-v-c:block]]\r\nvim.opt.guicursor    : append [[i-ci-ve:ver25]]\r\nvim.opt.guicursor    : append [[r-cr:hor20]]\r\nvim.opt.guicursor    : append [[o:hor50]]\r\nvim.opt.guicursor    : append [[a:blinkwait700-blinkoff400-blinkon250-Cursor/lCursor]]\r\nvim.opt.guicursor    : append [[sm:block-blinkwait175-blinkoff150-blinkon175]]\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhich stop cursor from \"inheriting\" the foreground, even in video-reverse - Here's a example:\r\n\r\nWithout said options:\r\n\r\n![Screenshot from 2024-03-29 10-39-29](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/assets/91024200/d50f0f0b-5964-4341-9687-e9e8864d7d91)\r\n![Screenshot from 2024-03-29 10-39-24](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/assets/91024200/a4057317-0101-4f8b-a09c-bd0a6bfdd440)\r\n![Screenshot from 2024-03-29 10-39-15](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/assets/91024200/0c8e7b57-1487-4627-b5e1-96a881e5d1fd)\r\n\r\n![Screenshot from 2024-03-29 10-42-11](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/assets/91024200/3f2ea677-cdc3-4962-9237-c97047f525cc)\r\n\r\n\r\nWith said options:\r\n\r\n![Screenshot from 2024-03-29 10-40-26](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/assets/91024200/2b519ea2-7b86-40a1-8217-3c788fdf1357)\r\n![Screenshot from 2024-03-29 10-40-21](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/assets/91024200/2d738738-2725-44b3-a8ae-16851a5cef41)\r\n![Screenshot from 2024-03-29 10-40-10](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/assets/91024200/e0e85c43-6271-4c3c-a911-dc1efd664f55)\r\n\r\n![Screenshot from 2024-03-29 10-42-21](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/assets/91024200/70afcaf4-8297-42fa-8fef-b9f5cdb49029)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
