            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "To be honest, currently this looks to me more like a misconfiguration issue.\r\n\r\n> MiniFiles should provide the Cursor highlight together with CursorLine.\r\n\r\nHow would you expect potential `MiniFilesCursor` to be used? In order to be useful, it looks like 'mini.files' itself should somehow force that cursor inside its windows is highlighted with this new highlight group. I don't think I've seen this done somewhere. Do you happen to know about any other plugins that had this/similar issue and resolved it with custom highlight group for cursor?",
